## Why This Is Asked

Tests practical Android background work design, energy awareness, and offline batching under real-world constraints.

## Key Concepts

- WorkManager constraints and Doze behavior
- Offline batching and idempotent batch processing
- Room data modeling for pending events and batch state
- Backoff, retry policies, and network churn handling

## Code Example

```kotlin
@Entity(tableName = "pending_events")
